  "reviewNotes": "Six native views at both crossing levels and both gantries plus north/south,100/50/5HP. Malachite/ivory north, amber/malachite south, lavender/ivory upper gantries, ivory/amber central crossing. Warm amber/green versus cool lavender gives the mirrored stations a different hierarchy from Delta cobalt/rose. Entire sloped buttresses retain area identity and inset trim carries accent. Final native representative view repeated after universal upward-facing floor-role correction and shared paint-program uniforms.",
